<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="en"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://moloney-james.com/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://moloney-james.com/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="en"/><updated>2026-04-14T12:55:53+00:00</updated><id>https://moloney-james.com/feed.xml</id><title type="html">James Moloney</title><subtitle>James Moloney | Mosquito biology and chemical ecology. Biochemistry PhD student at Virginia Tech. </subtitle><entry><title type="html">2025 Nutshell Games</title><link href="https://moloney-james.com/blog/2025/nutshell_games/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2025 Nutshell Games"/><published>2025-10-23T21:01:00+00:00</published><updated>2025-10-23T21:01:00+00:00</updated><id>https://moloney-james.com/blog/2025/nutshell_games</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://moloney-james.com/blog/2025/nutshell_games/"><![CDATA[<p>The Nutshell Games are a free, and open to the public competition put on by the <a href="https://communicatingscience.isce.vt.edu/">Virginia Tech Center for Communicating Science</a>. 30 PhD students presented their research in 90 seconds or less in front of a crowd on the main stage at the Moss Arts Center. My talk was on fly poison, a native Appalachian wildflower that apparently is loved by invasive mosquitoes!</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/outreach/IMG_2970.JPG" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/outreach/IMG_2970.JPG" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/outreach/nutshell3-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/outreach/nutshell3-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/outreach/nutshell3-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/outreach/nutshell3.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="caption"> I have a flair for the dramatic. Props are allowed in the competition and I chose to "become" my study species. </div> <p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hjC8Sdy9oes&amp;list=PLjNPzLCLK0StjoK2RXuHXi4BGeX3CPh_3&amp;index=28">Watch my talk!</a> It was professionally recorded as a part of the event.</p> <div class="row mt-3"> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/outreach/nutshell1-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/outreach/nutshell1-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/outreach/nutshell1-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/outreach/nutshell1.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> <div class="col-sm mt-3 mt-md-0"> <figure> <picture> <source class="responsive-img-srcset" srcset="/assets/img/outreach/nutshell2-480.webp 480w,/assets/img/outreach/nutshell2-800.webp 800w,/assets/img/outreach/nutshell2-1400.webp 1400w," type="image/webp" sizes="95vw"/> <img src="/assets/img/outreach/nutshell2.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded z-depth-1" width="100%" height="auto" loading="eager" onerror="this.onerror=null; $('.responsive-img-srcset').remove();"/> </picture> </figure> </div> </div> <div class="caption"> I have never had a fear of public speaking, but this was a little daunting! The view from the stage was formidable. </div>]]></content><author><name></name></author><category term="outreach-at-VT"/><summary type="html"><![CDATA[90-Second Talk Competition for PhD Students]]></summary></entry></feed>